// Vitest Snapshot v1, https://vitest.dev/guide/snapshot.html

exports[`advanced settings safety > loads only on expansion and renders localized settings snapshots > chinese advanced settings 1`] = `"高级设置共享 SSH 配置与外部编辑器偏好对所有 Remote SSH 主机生效，不会删除已有主机条目和工作区自定义 SSH 配置文件用于主机发现、SSH 连接与测试。设置后统一传入一个 -F 参数；与服务器自带的 -F 参数冲突时会拒绝连接。远端文件打开方式自动检测 VSC 编辑器（推荐）Visual Studio CodeCursorWindsurfVSCodium自定义 VSC 兼容编辑器总是下载后在本机打开这些选项仅控制外部打开，不影响 Better Sidebar 应用内预览；下载文件是本地副本，不会自动同步修改仅修改草稿，保存后生效；不会移除主机条目和工作区恢复默认放弃保存重新读取已保存设置连接诊断检查 SSH 访问，或逐阶段验证新建 Agent Host 连接"`;

exports[`advanced settings safety > loads only on expansion and renders localized settings snapshots > english advanced settings 1`] = `"Advanced settingsShared SSH configuration and external editor preferencesApplies to all Remote SSH hosts. Existing host entries and workspaces are preserved.Custom SSH config fileUsed for host discovery, SSH connections and probes. A selected file supplies one -F option; conflicting server -F arguments are rejected.Open remote files withAuto-detect VSC editor (recommended)Visual Studio CodeCursorWindsurfVSCodiumCustom VSC-compatible editorAlways download and open locallyThese options control external opening only. Better Sidebar in-app previews are unchanged. Downloaded files are local copies, not synchronized edits.Changes the draft only. Save to apply; host entries and workspaces are not removed.Restore defaultsDiscardSaveReload saved settingsConnection diagnosticsCheck SSH access or trace a new Agent Host connection"`;
